  ![nuneybits Vector art of robot secretary typing on glowing typew bdb6fb50-e1f2-4f80-a241-560e6d906a91](https://venturebeat.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.ctfassets.net%2Fjdtwqhzvc2n1%2F2A4wsP5BX8u0ZylzUEOncb%2Fd97852834fdd610f61a1f5d79609d4ea%2Fnuneybits_Vector_art_of_robot_secretary_typing_on_glowing_typew_bdb6fb50-e1f2-4f80-a241-560e6d906a91.webp%3Fw%3D1000%26q%3D100&w=3840&q=85)
  
